<p>Hey there, friends! Welcome back to this humble blog. Today we’re going to take a look at the differences between the TV and the BD versions of Episode #18 of Stone Ocean, “Enter the Foo Fighters”! A bit of a weird title, if you ask me, but that’s not the only weird thing about this fight, to be frank. Unfortunately it’s not going to be a very long comparison, but by now I think you’re probably used to these shorter posts for SO episodes - so without further ado…</p>

<p><br /></p>

<p>Let’s get started!</p>

<p><br /></p>

<ul>
  <li>First off, this shot of Kenzou standing in front of F.F. while they get electrocuted is now brighter:</li>
</ul>

