<p>And that concludes today’s <em>shocking</em> comparison. Sometimes I like to fantasize about a different world where Stone Ocean got the Blu-Ray correction it deserved… I wonder how this adaptation would have looked with a fresh coat of paint. Instead all we get is a fresh coat of pain. Ah well. See you next time for Stone Ocean #19 - “Birth of the “Green””!</p>

